 "descriptionHtml": "<p>A watch strap, kept for the finger. A wide band built like a classic watch bracelet: three rows of polished links with a softly scalloped edge, smooth on the inside. Heavy looking, comfortable to wear, and very good with a real watch on the same hand.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Wear it on the hand with your watch.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Width: Approximately 11mm</li>\n<li>Construction: Three rows of polished links with a softly scalloped edge</li>\n<li>Inside: Smooth and polished</li>\n<li>Sizes: US 6, 7 and 8</li>\n<li>Plating: 18k gold tone plated or rhodium plated silver tone (choose above)</li>\n<li>Material: Surgical stainless steel</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Waterproof and tarnish free, so daily wear and water are fine. Keep it away from perfume and harsh chemicals, wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
